# Version of the cicaid package that the AI PR review workflow installs.
#
# This lives outside .github/workflows/ deliberately: GitHub hard-blocks a
# workflow's default GITHUB_TOKEN from pushing any change under that
# directory, whatever permissions the job is granted, so a pin written
# inline in a workflow file can only ever be bumped by a PAT carrying the
# `workflow` scope. Keeping it here means an automated bump needs no extra
# credential (leonarduk/cicaid-pro#527).
#
# requirements-automation.txt pins the same version separately and is not
# read by this file; keep the two in step when bumping.
#
# NOTE: this repo still installs the pre-split single package
# (cicaid-devtools from the cicaid-pro repo, v0.9.x). cicaid-pro has since
# split into cicaid-devtools + cicaid-devtools-pro, and cicaid's own
# update-cicaid.yml automation assumes that two-package layout, so it is
# deliberately not scaffolded here yet.
#
# Only a KEY=<tag> line is honoured; the install step rejects anything else.
CICAID_PRO_REF=v0.9.1
